{"4187380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In The Mist of War", "steam_appid": 4187380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4779250], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Engage in a non-pay-to-win tactical battle.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The enemy forces are standing across a veiled terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assemble your horde and devise a plot to deceive and defeat your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategically set your starting formation, scout your surroundings, and expand your forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/4582e2c9bbd4a635bd4144d28c2df10d.webp?t=1780591869\" width=780 height=10 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat your enemy by eliminating all their units, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or seize control of key positions on the battlefield long enough to win by Domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One point is awarded for each area dominated per round, the first player to reach 30 points wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/0ddb5a7dd51555a35786ecf61a012707.avif?t=1780591869\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/4582e2c9bbd4a635bd4144d28c2df10d.webp?t=1780591869\" width=780 height=10 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are six different types of units. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each unit has unique attributes and abilities, but they all share one common feature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All units can eliminate or be eliminated by any opposing unit in a single attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each unit has a movement cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/35b42ba04c546532f74767816366bc75.avif?t=1780591869\" width=390 height=475 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/54fc92e674f18ea98f2c461438010f72.avif?t=1780591869\" width=390 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/4582e2c9bbd4a635bd4144d28c2df10d.webp?t=1780591869\" width=780 height=10 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get 10 movement points every round. Each turn lasts for 60 seconds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A solid starting strategy and effective planning during your opponent's turn </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">will help you avoid running out of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/8c290eaceee2a34579f7703b077cc952.avif?t=1780591869\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Engage in a non-pay-to-win tactical battle.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The enemy forces are standing across a veiled terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assemble your horde and devise a plot to deceive and defeat your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategically set your starting formation, scout your surroundings, and expand your forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/4582e2c9bbd4a635bd4144d28c2df10d.webp?t=1780591869\" width=780 height=10 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat your enemy by eliminating all their units, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or seize control of key positions on the battlefield long enough to win by Domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One point is awarded for each area dominated per round, the first player to reach 30 points wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/0ddb5a7dd51555a35786ecf61a012707.avif?t=1780591869\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/4582e2c9bbd4a635bd4144d28c2df10d.webp?t=1780591869\" width=780 height=10 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are six different types of units. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each unit has unique attributes and abilities, but they all share one common feature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All units can eliminate or be eliminated by any opposing unit in a single attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each unit has a movement cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/35b42ba04c546532f74767816366bc75.avif?t=1780591869\" width=390 height=475 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/54fc92e674f18ea98f2c461438010f72.avif?t=1780591869\" width=390 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/4582e2c9bbd4a635bd4144d28c2df10d.webp?t=1780591869\" width=780 height=10 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get 10 movement points every round. Each turn lasts for 60 seconds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A solid starting strategy and effective planning during your opponent's turn </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">will help you avoid running out of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/extras/8c290eaceee2a34579f7703b077cc952.avif?t=1780591869\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In the Mist of War is a turn-based online PvP strategy game. Select your units, position them strategically, and outsmart your opponent in a tactical top-down fog-of-war battle.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/2ba7c8d103cc0ff5c53e5feb8be0df384cb44c56/header.jpg?t=1780591869", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/199c9aac76798f22d39735b15f9b6a890cbb32dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780591869", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187380/199c9aac76798f22d39735b15f9b6a890cbb32dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780591869", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 7520U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon 610M<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Wilio Gaming Studio"], "publishers": ["Wilio Gaming Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 4779250, "descrip